---
// Archivo posters: width as speed, a condensed headline wall, extended stillness.
---
<figure class="pw-p" id="archivo-acceleration" data-name="Acceleration">
  <div class="pw-art ar-a">
    {[62, 75, 87, 100, 112, 125].map((w, i) => <p style={`font-variation-settings:'wght' ${300 + i * 120}, 'wdth' ${w}`}>FAST</p>)}
    <p class="ar-a__f"><span>Archivo</span><span>wdth 62 → 125</span></p>
  </div>
</figure>
<figure class="pw-p" id="archivo-headline" data-name="Headline">
  <div class="pw-art ar-b">
    <p class="ar-b__mast">THE DAILY<b>ARCHIVO</b></p>
    <p class="ar-b__h">MARKETS RALLY AS CITY REOPENS ITS RIVERFRONT</p>
    <p class="ar-b__s">Condensed for the columns. Wide for the shouts. One family, one axis.</p>
    <div class="ar-b__cols">{Array.from({ length: 3 }, () => <p>Archivo was drawn for high-performance typography: newspapers, posters and the kind of interface that has to say a lot in very little room.</p>)}</div>
  </div>
</figure>
<figure class="pw-p" id="archivo-wide-open" data-name="Wide open">
  <div class="pw-art ar-c">
    <p class="ar-c__w">wide</p>
    <p class="ar-c__o">open</p>
    <span class="ar-c__line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <p class="ar-c__f">ARCHIVO EXPANDED THIN · 125 / 100</p>
  </div>
</figure>
<style>
  .ar-a { background: #ff4a1c; color: #111; font-family: 'Archivo Variable', sans-serif; display: grid; align-content: center; padding: 0 5cqi; }
  .ar-a p:not(.ar-a__f) { font-size: 23cqi; line-height: 0.78; letter-spacing: -0.02em; white-space: nowrap; }
  .ar-a__f { position: absolute; left: 5cqi; right: 5cqi; bottom: 5cqi; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 2.6cqi; font-variation-settings: 'wght' 600, 'wdth' 100; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .ar-b { background: #f2efe8; color: #111; font-family: 'Archivo Variable', sans-serif; padding: 6cqi; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3cqi; }
  .ar-b__mast { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; border-bottom: 1.2cqi solid #111; padding-bottom: 2cqi; font-size: 3cqi; font-variation-settings: 'wght' 700, 'wdth' 100; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
  .ar-b__mast b { font-weight: 400; font-size: 9cqi; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-variation-settings: 'wght' 900, 'wdth' 125; }
  .ar-b__h { font-size: 15.6cqi; line-height: 0.86; letter-spacing: -0.01em; font-variation-settings: 'wght' 800, 'wdth' 62; }
  .ar-b__s { font-size: 4.4cqi; line-height: 1.15; font-style: italic; font-variation-settings: 'wght' 400, 'wdth' 87; border-top: 0.4cqi solid #111; padding-top: 2cqi; }
  .ar-b__cols { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 3cqi; font-size: 2.3cqi; line-height: 1.35; font-variation-settings: 'wght' 400, 'wdth' 75; margin-top: auto; }
  .ar-c { background: #111; color: #f2efe8; font-family: 'Archivo Variable', sans-serif; }
  .ar-c__w, .ar-c__o { position: absolute; left: 6cqi; font-size: 32cqi; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-variation-settings: 'wght' 100, 'wdth' 125; }
  .ar-c__w { top: 14cqi; } .ar-c__o { bottom: 16cqi; color: #ff4a1c; font-variation-settings: 'wght' 900, 'wdth' 125; }
  .ar-c__line { position: absolute; left: 6cqi; right: 6cqi; top: 62.5cqi; height: 0.3cqi; background: #f2efe844; }
  .ar-c__f { position: absolute; left: 6cqi; bottom: 6cqi; font-size: 2.4cqi; letter-spacing: 0.2em; font-variation-settings: 'wght' 500, 'wdth' 125; opacity: 0.6; }
</style>
